tsuko is a girl who loves to measure everything around her, and she won't be satisfied unless she's measured down to the tiniest detail!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's Shuuji's childhood friend. His grandfather taught her how fun science could be, and she's been devoted to the field ever since."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a daily routine of measuring her own body in millimeters and adding it to her records every morning. Ask her about her figure and she'll give her most up-to-date measurements without a second thought!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's very good with numbers, but between you and me, she's kinda clumsy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from English official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55333"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の幼馴染み。物理を愛するリケジョ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛いや、おいしい、など、抽象的・感覚的な気持ちを信用していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身の回りのあらゆる物を計測する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学校の机、教室の寸法はもちろん、外壁の強度、温度、湿度、緯度経度、あらゆるものを計測している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15670","sourceWorkId":"24197","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"あらゆるものを計測し、あらゆる言葉を定義しないと気が済まない定義ガール。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"修二の幼なじみであり、幼少期に修二の祖父から科学の楽しさを教わって以来、ずっと理系畑を歩んできた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"毎朝 自分のスリーサイズをmm単位で計測し、記録するのが日課。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"スタイルの話をすると、何のためらいもなく最新のスリーサイズを教えてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名前の通り数字には強いが、実は不器用な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「可愛いとか格好いいとか、そういう抽象的な話はやめてもらえますか」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49606"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15670","sourceWorkId":"24197","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"165 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15670","sourceWorkId":"24197","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7b/7b29a50cdd66087e220fb9fa452600af77f95b25311a8170a109ce860892593c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/5483c8f16df4be3e4d9cb7bf6a538665e6452cde2215d15bc2eedc5fa0b2817a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"五十嵐裕美","creatorId":"vndb:s77","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s77","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s77","name":"五十嵐 裕美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:198732:49606:5208:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55334","characterName":"九十九 春","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"49607","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"198732"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15671"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55334"},"originalCharacterName":"九十九 春","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"22"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“You see, this starry sky is the only thing that connects me and my hometown.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haru is an exchange student from Japan, studying astronomy in 17th century England."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her grandfather was the one to originally move abroad, but Japan closed its borders and isolated itself from the world soon after."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of this, Haru was born in England, unable to see the Japan she yearns for."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the only person who truly understands Alice, and they support each other while spending their days together in Tenbridge."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her true identity is revealed to be Edmund Halley."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From English official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55334"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本からイギリスに、天文学を学びに留学に来た日本人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日本地図を描いた伊能忠敬の先祖に当たる家系の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"留学中に日本が鎖国を始めてしまい、帰れなくなってしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"絵に描いたようなヤマトナデシコ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アリスにとっての一番の理解者が春。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15671","sourceWorkId":"24197","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"17世紀のイギリスで天文学を学んでいる、日本からの留学生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祖父の代で渡英したのはいいものの、その後 日本は鎖国。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"イギリスで生まれ育った春は一度も日本を見たことがなく、強い憧れを持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アリスの唯一の理解者であり、互いに支え合いながら日々を送っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「この星空だけがね、私と故郷の、繋がりなんだ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49607"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15671","sourceWorkId":"24197","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15671","sourceWorkId":"24197","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/213bfb2ba9aaf13c425708401958460d52b7a8da695f85bebc6f38a7aef9ca15.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8fb6903344f464a83f663d95cca5fe3baa8a3cda6423ce939d3cda7e378c262d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小倉結衣","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:198732:49607:5936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55335","characterName":"ラビ・ジエール","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"49608","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"198732"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15672"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55335"},"originalCharacterName":"ラビ・ジエール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"146"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“You're getting excited even though I've got a flat chest? Why's that? Show me!”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A problematic girl who's constantly causing fires all around Tenbridge University."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unlike Alice's theoretical and factual approach to science, she's a genius scientist who lets intuition guide her hand."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She lives in an age where modern science, magic, and alchemy coexist. If her intuition is telling her \"yes,\" then you bet she's gonna do it!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was the first to figure out that Shuuji wasn't from her time, igniting her curiosity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"What she wants the most right now is a male test subject that listens to everything she says."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her true identity is revealed to be Antoine Lavoisier."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from English official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55335"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アリスと対をなす奇才科学者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理屈よりも直感を重視するタイプで、主人公がこの時代の人間ではないと瞬時に見抜く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名門・テンブリッジ大学において錬金術を研究している変わり者。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15672","sourceWorkId":"24197","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"テンブリッジのあちこちで、しょっちゅう火災を起こしている問題児。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"理論派のアリスとは対照的に、直感と推測で結論を導き出す奇才科学者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"近代科学と錬金術が共存していた時代、自分の直感が Yes と言えば"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"科学も魔術も気にせずに取り入れる自由な発想の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"修二がこの時代の人間ではないと誰よりも早く見抜き、猛烈に好奇心を抱く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今一番欲しいものは、素直に言うことを聞いてくれる男性被験者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ちっちゃい乳房でも興奮するのか？ ナゼだ？ 理由を教エロ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49608"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"a","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15672","sourceWorkId":"24197","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"146 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15672","sourceWorkId":"24197","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/088cf18a040d2efbbc33080e4cf28ca2f28252ff4b0a9b4ac2eb7409468efa27.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/03f755013b5295a2c65f2e1403fd26f9dc004c6e53d54e44b97a548fcad196f7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"民安ともえ","creatorId":"vndb:s23","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23","name":"民安 ともえ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:198732:49608:5900:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55336","characterName":"エミー・フェルトン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"49609","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"198732"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15673"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55336"},"originalCharacterName":"エミー・フェルトン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"149"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Yay, potatoes! I simply love potatoes!!”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Emmy works as a maid at Tenbridge University to support her younger brothers. Her work takes her all over campus, so if you ever want to know anything about the place, she's the girl to ask!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She resides in the same dorm as Alice and Haru, handling all of the household chores such as laundry, cleaning duty, and cooking meals, while also looking after all of the residents."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She takes her job very seriously, never removing her headband while she's at work. This means your only chance to see her with her hair down is when she's off the clock!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though you'd need to be a lucky guy to see that. She works every day, leaving her with only enough time to spend with those truly close to her. That's exactly why her headband is so valuable to her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From English official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55336"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い弟たちの為に、テンブリッジで勤務しているメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"エミーも科学が大好きだが、学費を払えないどころか、亡くなった両親に替わり弟の世話もしなければならないため、自分の夢を押し殺してメイドの仕事をしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15673","sourceWorkId":"24197","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い弟たちのために、テンブリッジで勤務しているメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テンブリッジ全体で執務しているためキャンパス全体について詳しく、顔も利く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アリスや春と同じ寮で生活していて、掃除や料理など寮生の世話係も兼任している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事中はカチューシャを外さない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"つまり多忙な彼女のノン・カチューシャ姿を見られるのは、特別な関係の人物だけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だからこそ、カチューシャには価値がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「わーいジャガイモっ！ わたし、ジャガイモ大好きです!!」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49609"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"c","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15673","sourceWorkId":"24197","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"149 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15673","sourceWorkId":"24197","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21572c9d3faf7e6a76670a81940af8053ebec13f30bbc6231893c8f786bc9319.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/66/666ff1a7e3f566ca35488b7452b406b127ae4d25ed48d8d359837fe30d139917.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三宅麻理恵","creatorId":"vndb:s2258","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2258","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2258","name":"三宅 麻理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:198732:49609:6846:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c55337","characterName":"朝永 修二","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"49610","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"198732"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15674"],"vndbCharacterId":"c55337"},"originalCharacterName":"朝永 修二","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“They might not make you bleed, but words can be deadly too, you know!”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A teenager that hates science. Our protagonist. Also a virgin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His grandfather was the second Japanese physicist to be awarded a Nobel Prize. Shuuji and his childhood friend, Yotsuko, have been mentored by him ever since they were young."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A science-loving boy, but the constant comparisons to his grandfather made him grow sick of it. One day, his grandfather went on a trip to England, only to end up going missing. Shuuji was in so much shock that he started writing music to escape reality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"And so he lived as a miserable virgin, until he was reunited with Yotsuko and they somehow ended up being flung through time. Shuuji now finds himself surrounded by four strange girls (and Yotsuko), and to make matters worse, he's the only one with a lick of common sense!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from English official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55337"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"科学嫌いの思春期男子。主人公。童貞。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祖父の朝永修一郎は、日本で二人目のノーベル物理学賞受賞者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少期は、幼馴染みである四五と一緒に祖父から科学を教わり、科学が大好きな少年だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが、常に偉大すぎる祖父と比べられる学生時代を過ごし、気付けばすっかり物理アレルギーに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんなある日、自由奔放だった祖父が、イギリス旅行に行ったまま行方不明になり修二も現実から逃げるように冴えない音楽活動をしていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな童貞があれよあれよとタイムトラベルしてしまい、気付けば４人＋１人のマイペースな女の子に囲まれ、常識人は自分１人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインに寄り添い悩みを解決しながら、消えた祖父の謎を追う修二のドラマが物語の縦軸になる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15674","sourceWorkId":"24197","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"科学嫌いの思春期男子。 主人公。 童貞。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"祖父は日本で2人目のノーブル物理学賞受賞者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少期は四五と一緒に祖父から科学を教わり、科学が大好きな少年だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし偉大すぎる祖父と比べられる学生時代を過ごし、すっかり物理アレルギーに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在 祖父がイギリス旅行で行方不明になり、自身も現実から逃げるように冴えない音楽活動を行っていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし幼なじみとの再会をきっかけにタイムトラベルしてしまい、気づけば 4＋1人のマイペースな女の子に囲まれ、常識人は自分1人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインに寄り添い悩みを解決しながら、消えた祖父の謎を追う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「血は出ないけど、言葉だって立派な凶器になるんだからね!?」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"49610"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"175 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15674","sourceWorkId":"24197","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0a9b56b89a8cc28a0d909c70695fd4f9d9d38e67aba631fd87da32881e69662.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aae919067a1d43a7de0d3e45a7c936b58e5bd6a45dbef32275ee33328b177b00.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c55332","characterName":"アリス・べッドフォッド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c55332"},"originalCharacterName":"アリス・べッドフォッド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"148"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“Hey, you're still a virgin, aren't you? I can tell, even though I'm younger than you.”"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An extremely bright girl who enrolled at Tenbridge University after skipping grades."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because it was prohibited by law for women to write theses, she used the pen name \"Isaac Newton.\" That's why she went down in history as a man."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With her exceptional abilities, on top of her excessive pride and greed, she is almost untouchable on the campus."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a bad habit of adding notes to the books inside the library without permission. Barely a book has escaped her scientific scribbles!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From English official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c55332"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d1/d1479a6ed7289dd70bc17d5be9e2a73b3b2415a9befd9b012f1f0c9793905b2c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c6e83add73b2ed199a696e1904494b8209c3faea5fc0ea80e00a573a3473ba20.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"秋野 花","creatorId":"vndb: